asr(3, `evidence`, `Homologous organs show divergent evolution.`, `Homologous organs have a similar structure but different functions and arise from a common ancestor.`, 0, `Both are true. Organs with the same origin become modified for different functions in different environments. That is divergence, so R explains A.`);
