match(3, `evidence`, `ev-m1`, `Examples and the type of evidence or process`, [`A. Forelimbs of whale and bat`, `B. Wings of bird and butterfly`, `C. Peppered moth in England`, `D. Darwin\'s finches`], [`p. Natural selection seen within decades`, `q. Adaptive radiation`, `r. Homologous organs`, `s. Analogous organs`], `A-r, B-s, C-p, D-q`, [`A-s, B-r, C-p, D-q`, `A-r, B-s, C-q, D-p`, `A-p, B-s, C-r, D-q`], `Forelimbs share an origin (homologous, r). Wings of bird and butterfly differ in origin (analogous, s). Peppered moth shows selection within decades (p). Finches radiated from one ancestor (q).`);
