match(3, `human evolution`, `ev-m3`, `Hominid and feature`, [`A. Homo habilis`, `B. Homo erectus`, `C. Neanderthal man`, `D. Ramapithecus`], [`p. About 900 cc brain, probably meat eater`, `q. About 1400 cc brain, buried the dead`, `r. 650 to 800 cc brain, first human-like being`, `s. More man-like than Dryopithecus, about 15 million years ago`], `A-r, B-p, C-q, D-s`, [`A-p, B-r, C-q, D-s`, `A-r, B-q, C-p, D-s`, `A-s, B-p, C-q, D-r`], `The brain sizes and habits are in NCERT: habilis 650 to 800 cc, erectus 900 cc, Neanderthal 1400 cc, and Ramapithecus was more man-like.`);

